# Tinybones, Bauble Burglar: the permission is for "cards you don't own with stash counters on them", not every card in exile,
# and the exile is for "an opponent discards" (CR 701.9a, 122.1). Bot1 casts Tinybones on turn 1. On turn 2 Bot2 casts Ornithopter.
# On turn 3 Bot1's Swords to Plowshares exiles it, with no counter, so Bot1 can't cast it from exile though an Ornithopter
# costs {0} and it is Bot1's main phase. Faithless Looting then has Bot1 discard two Swamps of its own: they stay in Bot1's graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Tinybones, Bauble Burglar
Swords to Plowshares
Faithless Looting
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mountain x6
Mountain x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tinybones, Bauble Burglar.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Ornithopter
! Bot1.Exile.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Swamp; Swamp)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Swamp; Swamp; Swords to Plowshares
Exile = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Ruby; Swamp; Tinybones, Bauble Burglar
